      "bullets": [
        ">>>Caveats",
        "Synthetic data; semantic views padded to realistic size, not real complexity",
        "Client-side master is a minimal router; a heavier orchestrator adds tokens",
        "Cache reads are discounted, so B-at-scale dollar impact is smaller than token counts suggest",
        "MCP Apps is in preview; rendering validated via API, not yet in a desktop client",
        ">>>Next steps",
        "Run the repo against your semantic views and questions",
        "Enable MCP Apps on your account and wire _mcp_app into the React app",
        "Decide: consolidate views vs. MCP delegation for the 14-domain rollout"
